desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "python"
	title: "源码扫描：Python Cookie secure=False"
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Python Cookie secure=False"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-python-set-cookie-secure-false"
	risk: "cookie-security"
	cwe: "CWE-614"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
set_cookie(..., secure=False) 允许浏览器在明文 HTTP 上发送该 Cookie。

### 风险类型
cookie-security

### 影响
命中说明代码里出现了该危险 API、配置或数据流入口。

### 检测方式
源码模式正则匹配，定位源码中的危险调用或配置。
### 参考
- CWE-614
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
会话 Cookie 设置 secure=True，并且只通过 HTTPS 提供服务。
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://bad.py": <<<POS
def bad(resp):
    resp.set_cookie("sid", "v", secure=False)

POS
	"safefile://ok.py": <<<NEG
def ok(resp):
    resp.set_cookie("sid", "v", secure=True)

NEG
)
${*.py}.pattern_regex(/set_cookie\s*\([^)]*secure\s*=\s*False/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "源码扫描：Python Cookie secure=False",
	title_zh: "源码扫描：Python Cookie secure=False",
	message: "源码扫描：Python Cookie secure=False",
	risk: "cookie-security",
}
